%% B. Detailed data flow — from user input to explained report
flowchart TB
  U["User"] -->|typed answer or free text| Q["Intake: next-question / answers"]
  U -->|PDF / image upload| D0["Documents: validate upload (magic bytes, size, pages)"]
  U -->|manual offer entry| OFF["LoanOffer (stated terms)"]

  Q -->|free text only| P["Answer parser (LLM #1, JSON schema)"]
  P --> F["FinancialFact ledger (append-only, provenance, status)"]
  Q -->|typed value| F
  F --> PROF["FinancialProfile view + conflicts + completeness"]
  PROF --> RANK["Question ranker: requirement + sensitivity − effort − privacy"]
  RANK -->|QuestionCandidate + why_we_ask| Q

  D0 --> TXT["PyMuPDF text layer / page images"]
  TXT --> RED["Redaction (SSN, account numbers) in text mode"]
  RED --> EXT["Extraction (LLM #2): value + page + verbatim quote per field"]
  EXT --> VER["Verifier: quote match, arithmetic, ranges, product type"]
  VER --> HV["Human verification table (confirm / edit / mark missing)"]
  HV --> OFF
  OFF -->|ready_for_calculation| ENG

  PROF --> ENG["engine.compute → CalculationResult (metrics, schedule, flags)"]
  ENG --> SC["scenarios.run_catalog → ScenarioResult[] + ResilienceSummary"]
  ENG --> CFX["counterfactual.evaluate → alternatives, Pareto set, lever sensitivity"]
  SC --> CFX
  ENG --> PLAN["explain.build_plans → ExplanationPlan per section (allowed numbers, citations)"]
  SC --> PLAN
  CFX --> PLAN
  PLAN --> TPL["Templates (deterministic text)"]
  PLAN --> NAR["Narration (LLM #3)"]
  NAR --> GATE{"Numeric membership + deny-list gate"}
  GATE -->|pass| REP
  GATE -->|fail| TPL
  TPL --> REP["DecisionReport (snapshot, calc_version, provenance)"]
  REP --> UI["Dashboard: Now · With this loan · Under stress · Alternatives · Missing info · Report"]
  UI --> U
